// Copy to Configs/Secrets.xcconfig (ignored by git) to switch the app from the fakes to the
// real backend: Better Auth sign-in and the Convex gateway, both at this one address. Empty, the
// app stays on the fakes (Debug) or has no cloud features (Release). Steps: docs/backend-switch.md.
//
// Not a secret: the backend URL ships inside the app. No key of any kind goes here; Better Auth's
// secret and every other server key live only in Convex environment variables.

// The Convex deployment's HTTP actions URL (ends in .convex.site, not .convex.cloud).
// xcconfig files treat // as a comment, so the slashes are split with $().
NOOK_API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/beaming-oyster-905.convex.site
